msgstr "Proovi vaadata kuuarhiividest. %1$s"

msgid "Sorry, but nothing matched your search terms. Please try again with some different keywords."
msgstr "Vabandust, kuid otsingu tulemusi ei leitud. Palun proovi teiste märksõnadega."

msgid "It seems we can&rsquo;t find what you&rsquo;re looking for. Perhaps searching can help."
msgstr "Tundub, et me ei leia, mida otsite. Võib-olla otsing aitab."

msgid "Pages:"
msgstr "Lehed:"

